 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Kept all 5 old kinds; added Oatmeal stout, Foreign extra stout (planned) and American stout (BJCP 20B, enthusiasts expect it). Irish extra stout and tropical stout folded in as types. Baltic porter left to the dark-lager shelf. Barrel-aged is a type of imperial stout. Bourbon County variant names (Coffee etc.) left out: not on any retrieved page. Beers named only in BJCP lists stay in m; no traditions apply (brewing styles, not artisan crafts)."
}